; ── Signature self-luminous-landmark practicals ────────────────
; A ~1 km god's-eye region backdrop can't carry a light at every
; lamppost/window without violating the "economical, not crazy"
; rule, but its iconic SELF-LUMINOUS fixtures (a lighthouse beacon,
; the neon parapet signs) ARE the identity and must glow for the
; dusk / candlelight arcana moods. Four practicals, each at the real
; fixture geometry (blender (bx,by,bz) → godot (bx,bz,-by)).

; Hermit — the lighthouse is DEAD since 2026-10-04 (broken at ten
; metres, lantern room fallen; build_graustark _build_hermit_lighthouse_
; ruin): its beacon is gone. The quarter's only light is Joanna's
; writing candle on the desk in the patched shotgun house — blender
; (54.05, -379.75, 1.365) → godot (54.05, 1.365, 379.75). It lights the
; room and the east and south panes from outside at dusk and night.
[node name="Practical_Candle" type="OmniLight3D" parent="."]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 54.05, 1.40, 379.75)
light_color = Color(1.0, 0.66, 0.34, 1)
light_energy = 0.7
omni_range = 4.5

; Frasier's yard light (2026-10-05): sodium over the warehouse lot, so the
; brick and the kudzu read in the Magician's purple night. Blender
; (286, 350.05, 7.7) → godot.
; The fence light (2026-10-05): halfway up the kudzu fence. Blender
; (263.45, 371.0, 6.7) → godot.
